@host = http://localhost:5285

### Listar hábitos
GET {{host}}/api/habits
Accept: application/json

### Crear hábito
POST {{host}}/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leer 20 minutos",
  "description": "Antes de dormir",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Obtener un hábito
GET {{host}}/api/habits/1

### Editar hábito
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leer 30 minutos",
  "description": null,
  "startDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Días cumplidos de un hábito
GET {{host}}/api/habits/1/completions

### Marcar un día como cumplido
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/1/completions/2026-10-18

### Desmarcar un día
DELETE {{host}}/api/habits/1/completions/2026-10-18

### Eliminar hábito
DELETE {{host}}/api/habits/1
